UPDATE companies SET description='RDO Equipment Co. operates a John Deere dealership in Hazen, North Dakota, serving the central region of the state. The location is part of a larger network of RDO Equipment Co. stores, though the founding year and ownership structure of the overall company are not disclosed on this page. The Hazen store is managed by Mike Miller, with Loren Henke handling aftermarket sales.

The dealership sells and services John Deere agriculture equipment, lawn and garden equipment, compact utility tractors, and utility vehicles. It maintains a parts inventory of approximately 650,000 items accessible through an online account system. Service capabilities include machine repair, field technician dispatch, custom hydraulic hose building, precision agriculture technology support, bulk oil and fluid delivery, machine inspections, and after-hours support. Parts can be delivered via route trucks or picked up at drop-off locations.

The company emphasizes a customer-driven approach, stating that its team focuses on building long-term relationships and trust rather than just making sales. It highlights its people as its most valuable asset and offers conveniences such as text alerts for service updates, curbside pickup, and connected equipment monitoring.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Machine service and repair", "Field service technician dispatch", "Custom hydraulic hose building", "Precision agriculture technology support", "Bulk oil and fluid delivery", "Machine inspections", "Connected equipment monitoring", "Parts route truck delivery", "Parts drop-off/pickup locations", "Curbside pickup", "Text alerts for parts and service status", "Service scheduling"], "industries": ["Agriculture", "Lawn and garden", "Compact utility tractors", "Utility vehicles"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["John Deere agriculture equipment", "John Deere lawn and garden equipment", "John Deere compact utility tractors", "John Deere utility vehicles (Gators)"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["650,000-part inventory with real-time online access", "After-hours and field service technician support", "Custom hydraulic hose building on site", "Precision agriculture technology expertise", "Bulk oil and fluid delivery service"], "facts_used": ["Location: Hazen, ND -> /", "John Deere dealer selling agriculture, lawn/garden, compact utility tractors, utility vehicles -> /", "Parts inventory of 650,000 items -> /", "Services: machine repair, field technicians, custom hydraulic hose building, precision ag support, bulk oil delivery, inspections, after-hours support -> /", "Parts delivery via route trucks and drop-off locations -> /", "Store manager Mike Miller, aftermarket sales professional Loren Henke -> /", "Customer-driven philosophy, relationship focus, people as most valuable asset -> /", "Text alerts, curbside pickup, connected equipment monitoring -> /"], "c