UPDATE companies SET description='REPOWER by Solar Universe Northeast PA operates from Mountain Top, Pennsylvania. The business traces its roots to 1988 when Tony and Susie Delldonna began a home construction company. In 2009 they added solar photovoltaic installation to their services, leveraging decades of building experience to integrate rooftop and ground-mount arrays.

The company provides full-service solar PV installation for residential and commercial customers. Installations range from roof-mounted arrays to ground-mount systems, including retrofits with microinverter technology. The team also provides post-installation monitoring support and warranty service.

Customers include homeowners throughout northeastern Pennsylvania and small businesses seeking to reduce electricity costs. Testimonials reference projects in Jefferson Township and other local communities, with system sizes such as 10.2 kW and 12.06 kW arrays. The company works directly with property owners and coordinates with excavators and utility inspectors.

The Delldonnas emphasize hands-on project management, noting they navigate supply-chain disruptions and bureaucratic hurdles on behalf of clients. Clients cite the firm’s practice of delivering a comprehensive warranty binder, competitive quotes with fixed timelines, and the ability to complete complex retrofits in a single day.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Solar PV installation", "Site assessment", "System design", "Permitting", "Utility interconnection", "Incentive and rebate processing", "System monitoring", "Maintenance and warranty service", "Ground mount installation", "Roof mount installation", "Retrofit with microinverters"], "industries": ["Residential", "Commercial", "Construction"], "materials": ["Solar PV modules", "Inverters", "Mounting systems"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": [], "facts_used": ["Founded 1988 as home construction company -> /", "Solar PV installation since 2009 -> /", "Headquarters in Mountain Top, Pennsylvania -> db", "Owners Tony and Susie Delldonna -> /", "Services: site assessment, design, permitting, installation, monitoring -> /", "Residential and commercial customers -> /", "Projects in Jefferson Township, PA -> /", "System sizes 10.2 kW, 12.06 kW -> /", "Handles permitting, utility applications, rebates -> /", "Provides warranty binder -> /", "Competitive quotes with timelines -> /", "One-day retrofit installation -> /", "Navigates supply chain issues -> /"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Looking for a reliable solar PV installation company?", "founded_year": "1988", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='repower-by-solar-universe-northeast-pa' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='RL Hudson was established in 1980 in Tulsa, Oklahoma, initially distributing rubber O-rings to the region''s oil industry. The company relocated to Broken Arrow in 2004 and remains under the leadership of the Hudson family, with Rick Hudson as chairman, Jason Hudson as CEO, and Blake Hudson heading sales and marketing.

The company operates as a full-service molder and assembler, running plastic injection presses from 85 to 4,000 tons with scientific (decoupled) molding monitored by AuthenTIG systems. It also produces custom rubber parts via injection, transfer, and compression molding, plus wrapped and extruded formed hoses. In-house tooling design, machining, and maintenance support both molding lines, while plastic welding (ultrasonic, spin, hot-plate, vibration), pad printing, and a high-volume automated assembly line round out the operation.

Customers rely on the firm for part consolidation, metal-to-plastic conversions, and end-to-end assembly of multi-component units.

The company emphasizes its integrated "under one roof" model—combining molding, rubber, welding, tooling, and assembly—to deliver tighter quality control, faster turnaround, and cost-effective solutions.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001','ISO 14001']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Plastic injection molding (scientific/decoupled molding)", "Overmolding", "Insert molding", "Rubber injection molding", "Rubber transfer molding", "Rubber compression molding", "Hose manufacturing (wrapped and extruded formed hoses)", "Tooling design", "Precision machining", "Tool maintenance and repair", "Check gage fabrication", "Error-proofing systems", "Custom fixture design", "Plastic welding (ultrasonic)", "Plastic welding (spin)", "Plastic welding (hot-plate)", "Plastic welding (vibration)", "Pad printing", "Unit assembly (simple to complex multi-component)", "Design and engineering support", "Quality control and error proofing"], "industries": ["Automotive", "HVAC", "Medium & heavy trucks", "Outdoor power equipment", "Powersports & off-highway vehicles", "Agriculture & off-highway equipment", "Appliances", "Marine", "Power generation", "Waterworks", "Heavy equipment", "Material handling", "On-highway engine"], "materials": ["Thermoplastic resins (commodity to ultra-high performance)", "Custom rubber compounds"], "equipment": ["Injection molding presses (85\u20134,000 tons)", "AuthenTIG real-time process monitoring", "Rubber injection molding machines", "Rubber transfer molding machines", "Rubber compression molding machines", "Hose manufacturing equipment (wrapped and extruded formed hoses)", "Plastic welding equipment (ultrasonic, spin, hot-plate, vibration)", "Pad printing equipment", "High-volume automated assembly line"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Scientific injection molding with real-time AuthenTIG monitoring", "In-house tooling design, machining, and maintenance", "Combined plastic and rubber molding with assembly under one roof", "Plastic welding (ultrasonic, spin, hot-plate, vibration) and pad printing", "Part consolidation expertise reducing supply chain steps"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1980 in Tulsa, OK -> /about-us", "Relocated to Broken Arrow, OK 2004 -> /about-us", "Family leadership (Rick, Jason, Blake Hudson) -> /about-us", "Plastic injection molding 85-4000 tons, scientific molding, AuthenTIG -> /capabilities", "Rubber injection, transfer, compression molding, hose manufacturing -> /capabilities", "In-house tooling design, machining, maintenance -> /capabilities", "Plastic welding (ultrasonic, spin, hot-plate, vibration) -> /capabilities", "Pad printing -> /capabilities", "Unit assembly, high-volume automated assembly line -> /capabilities", "Industries served listed on home page and about-us -> /, /about-us", "ISO 9001 (2004), ISO 14001 (2019), IATF (2023) -> /about-us", "Part consolidation, end-to-end solutions -> /, /capabilities", "Materials: wide range of resins, proprietary rubber compounds -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "RL Hudson is a trusted U.S. manufacturer specializing in custom plastic injection molding, rubber components and value-added unit assembly.", "founded_year": "1980", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='rl-hudson' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='RSP Supply operates from North Salt Lake, Utah, as a supplier of industrial automation and electrical components. The company''s founding year and ownership structure are not publicly disclosed.

The firm stocks a broad catalog of products from manufacturers such as ABB, Eaton, Phoenix Contact, and Square D, covering categories that include enclosures, circuit protection, motors and drives, power supplies, connectors, and networking equipment. In addition to distribution, RSP Supply provides custom fabrication services—building control panels to specification and modifying enclosures—as well as engineering support for industrial control systems and procurement assistance for hard-to-find parts.

Its customer base spans industries that rely on energy storage connectors, power and energy measurement, and general industrial automation.

RSP Supply differentiates itself with free U.S. ground parcel shipping on every order, a modest small-order fee for purchases under $100, and a focus on supply-chain support for difficult-to-source items.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Control panel fabrication", "Enclosure modification", "Engineering services", "Supply chain support", "Industrial automation services", "TSLOTS aluminum extrusion framing", "Procurement services", "Software services"], "industries": ["Energy storage connectors", "Energy & power measurement", "Power & energy meters", "Industrial automation"], "materials": ["Steel", "Stainless steel", "Aluminum", "Non-metallic (plastic/fiberglass)"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Free U.S. ground parcel shipping on all orders", "Small-order fee of $20 only for orders under $100", "Custom control panels built to exact specifications", "Enclosure modification services", "Engineering and automation support for industrial control systems"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: North Salt Lake, Utah -> db", "Business description: Industrial Automation & Electrical Components Supplier -> /", "Product brands carried: ABB, Eaton, Phoenix Contact, Square D, etc. -> /", "Custom fabrication services: control panel fabrication, enclosure modification -> /", "Engineering services and supply chain support -> /", "Free U.S. ground parcel shipping, small order fee under $100 -> /", "Industries served: energy storage connectors, energy & power measurement, power & energy meters -> db", "Capabilities: TSLOTS aluminum extrusion framing, control panel fabrication, procurement services, automation services -> db", "LinkedIn URL -> db"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Industrial Automation & Electrical Components Supplier", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_l