UPDATE companies SET description='RW Collective is headquartered in Rockford, Alabama, and operates a flagship showroom at 156 S. Main Street in High Point, North Carolina. The company was co-founded by Michael Carey and Rebekah Osborn, whose backgrounds in law enforcement and global manufacturing, respectively, shaped a platform built to connect people, product, and purpose. Carey, also owner of Atelier Home, serves as CEO, while Osborn, owner of Beyond Borders Furniture Co., serves as COO.

The company functions as a to-the-trade furniture line, offering a curated portfolio that includes handcrafted hardwoods and USA-made custom upholstery under the RW Custom Classics label. The custom upholstery program provides more than 300 fabric options with a standard lead time of four to six weeks. Wholesale partners receive tiered pricing, flexible ordering, and dedicated support with swatches and inventory updates.

RW Collective sells exclusively to retailers, interior designers, and industry professionals through its wholesale program. Its products are described as battle-tested in retail and design environments, and the company maintains year-round showrooms in major markets to serve those partners. The lineup spans living, dining, bedroom, and occasional furniture, including game tables designed for mahjong and cards.

The founders positioned the business around operational clarity and creative curation, aiming to deliver breadth, flexibility, and streamlined solutions that help dealers and designers sell more effectively. The emphasis on systems that work—from product development to logistics—reflects Carey’s operational background, while the aesthetic direction reflects Osborn’s global design perspective.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom upholstery", "Handcrafted hardwood furniture manufacturing", "Wholesale distribution", "Trade showroom operation", "Product development", "Supply chain management (Asia Pacific)", "Customizable finishes and fabrics", "Swatch program", "Inventory management", "Order fulfillment", "Logistics and shipping"], "industries": ["Furniture wholesale", "Interior design trade", "Retail furniture", "Home furnishings"], "materials": ["Fabrics (300+ options)", "Hardwoods", "Upholstery materials"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "4 to 6 weeks for custom upholstery", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["USA-made custom upholstery with 300+ fabrics and 4\u20136 week lead times", "Handcrafted hardwood furniture", "Wholesale-only trade model with tiered pricing and flexible ordering", "Showrooms in major markets including High Point, NC", "Dedicated trade support including swatch program and inventory updates"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Rockford, Alabama -> db", "Showroom at 156 S. Main Street, High Point, NC -> /about", "Co-founders Michael Carey and Rebekah Osborn -> /about", "Michael Carey background: 25 years law enforcement, owner of Atelier Home -> /about", "Rebekah Osborn background: owner of Beyond Borders Furniture Co., global manufacturing experience -> /about", "To-the-trade furniture line with curated portfolio -> /about", "Handcrafted hardwoods and USA-made custom upholstery -> /about", "RW Custom Classics: 300+ fabrics, 4-6 week lead times -> /", "Team includes plant manager, distribution center mana