UPDATE companies SET description='Ready Made Plastic Trays was founded in 1990 in Meridian, Idaho, and has operated as a domestic manufacturer of thermoformed plastic trays for over three decades. The company emphasizes American-made production and domestically sourced materials traceable to their original manufacturers.

