UPDATE companies SET description='Real Wood Furniture operates from Chantilly, Virginia, serving the Washington, D.C. metropolitan area including Northern Virginia and Maryland. The company presents itself as a furniture store offering a range of solid-wood pieces for residential and home-office settings.

