UPDATE companies SET description='Rebo Lighting and Electronics is headquartered in Sparta, Tennessee, with a major tech center in Plymouth, Michigan. The company traces its roots to the merger of Wagner and Tung-Sol, which created a automotive bulb manufacturer. The Sparta plant was launched in 1972 and celebrated its 50th anniversary in 2022.

Rebo develops and manufactures automotive lighting systems, including exterior and interior LED solutions. Its in-house capabilities span design, optics, metallization, projection and holographics, prototyping, surface-mount technology (SMT), high-speed automation, injection molding, and plastic welding. The Sparta facility handles manufacturing, injection molding, and fabrication, while the Plymouth tech center focuses on LED development and testing. The company serves over 40 global OEMs and has shipped more than five billion bulbs historically.

The primary industry served is automotive, with customers including major OEMs such as Ford, for which Rebo produced the first lit badge for the Mustang. The company operates globally with manufacturing and tech centers in the United States, Germany, China, and upcoming locations in Eastern Europe.

Rebo emphasizes its over 100 years of combined experience and a commitment to innovative, reliable lighting solutions that prioritize safety, comfort, and style.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Design", "Technology development", "Optics engineering", "Research and development", "Metallization", "Projection and holographics", "Prototyping", "Surface-mount technology (SMT)", "High-speed automation", "Injection molding", "Plastic welding", "Manufacturing", "Fabrication", "LED lighting development and testing"], "industries": ["Automotive", "Automotive lighting"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["SMT production line"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["In-house manufacturing, injection molding, and fabrication at Sparta, Tennessee facility", "Global footprint with tech centers and manufacturing sites in the US, Germany, and China", "Over 100 years of automotive lighting experience", "Surface-mount technology (SMT) production lines in multiple locations", "Dedicated LED development and testing at Plymouth, Michigan tech center"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Sparta, Tennessee -> db", "Plymouth, Michigan tech center for LED development and testing -> /", "Sparta plant launched 1972 -> / (products list)", "Merger of Wagner and Tung-Sol -> / (products list)", "Over 100 years of experience -> /capabilities", "In-house manufacturing, injection molding, fabrication at Sparta -> /", "Capabilities: Design, Optics, R&D, Metallization, Projection, Holographics, Prototyping, SMT, High Speed Automation, Injection Molding, Plastic Welding -> /capabilities", "Serves 40+ global OEMs -> /", "Shipped over 5 billion bulbs historically -> / (products list)", "First lit badge for Ford Mustang -> / (products list)", "Global locations: US, Germany, China, Eastern Europe -> /", "LinkedIn URL -> db"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "REBO Lighting & Electronics is a global development and supp