UPDATE companies SET description='Redefined Woodworking Co. operates from Menifee, California. The company was founded by Eric and Sara Ruby after Eric''s woodworking hobby, encouraged by his wife, grew into a business venture. Eric, a U.S. Naval Academy graduate with a mechanical engineering background, and Sara, a former teacher and mentor, relocated with the Navy before settling in Southern California to establish the shop.

The workshop produces custom furniture with a focus on dining tables, using heirloom-quality materials and experienced craftsmanship. Services include furniture design consulting, wood species education, delivery and assembly of finished pieces, and woodworking classes for enthusiasts.

The primary customers are residential clients seeking bespoke furniture that fits their space and aesthetic, particularly families wanting a durable gathering table. The company also serves individuals interested in learning woodworking through hands-on classes. Concrete examples from the input include clients who request custom tables with specific dimensions, wood species, and design details, as well as students enrolling in woodworking education.

