UPDATE companies SET description='Based in Framingham, Massachusetts, Restronics New England operates as a manufacturers'' representative firm led by Managing Partner Hunter Adams, who brings 35 years of industry experience. The company serves the six-state New England territory — Massachusetts, Rhode Island, Connecticut, New Hampshire, Vermont, and Maine — from its Framingham headquarters.

