UPDATE companies SET description='Rising Sun Solar Outfitters operates from Avon, Indiana. The family now lives the lifestyle they serve — camping in a solar-powered fifth wheel and powering their own home off-grid.

The company designs and installs custom solar systems for recreational vehicles and off-grid properties. Services include system design, installation, consultations, and detailed quotes. Each project is tailored to the customer''s specific goals and budget, with an emphasis on safety and reliability. No facility size, headcount, or production volumes are disclosed.

Primary customers are RV owners seeking mobile power freedom, owners of remote cabins or off-grid homes, and homeowners looking to reduce utility dependence. The company serves the RV/mobile market, off-grid residential sector, and broader renewable energy space, with concrete examples including Harvest Hosts and Boondockers Welcome overnight stays, cabin generator replacement, and whole-home off-grid conversions.

The business was born from firsthand experience: the founders wanted to run appliances silently while boondocking, keep food cold without generator noise, and maximize time away from hookups. That personal need drives their approach — they build systems they would trust for their own family''s comfort and independence.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["RV Solar Installation", "Off-Grid Solar Systems", "Solar System Design", "Consultations", "Quotes/Estimates"], "industries": ["RV/Mobile", "Off-Grid Residential", "Renewable Energy", "Cabin Power", "Home Energy Independence"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Customized systems based on customer goals and budget", "Personal off-grid living experience (family RV and home)", "Focus on safe and reliable system design", "Mobile service for RV installations"], "facts_used": ["Location: Avon, Indiana -> db", "Family-owned, started with first RV purchase -> /about-us", "Family camps in solar-powered fifth wheel, home is off-grid -> /about-us", "Services: RV solar installation, off-grid solar systems, solar system design, consultations, quotes -> db, /", "Target markets: RV owners, off-grid property owners, homeowners seeking energy independence -> /", "Customization based on goals and budget, emphasis on safety and reliability -> /", "Examples: Harvest Hosts, Boondockers Welcome, cabin generator replacement -> /"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Designing and installing RV and off-grid solar systems based on your goals and budget", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='rising-sun-solar-outfitters' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Rival Technologies, LLC is headquartered in Phoenix, Arizona. The company was founded on over three decades of expertise in textile fabrication, sourcing, and product design, aiming to streamline complex development cycles and deliver exceptional results globally. While a specific founding year is not disclosed, the business traces its roots to 30-plus years of industry experience. Gerry Van Wagner serves as CEO.

The company provides high-quality sewn products and comprehensive textile fabrication services. Its core processes include cut-and-sew manufacturing, thermoforming of hard-shell components, strap fabrication, anti-migration and silicone engineering, and supply of performance fabrics. Rival operates facilities in the United States, Vietnam, and China, enabling scalable, cost-effective production. The team is described as lean and capable, supporting rapid prototyping and an engineering-led phase-gate methodology that manages product development from concept through commercialization.

Rival serves sectors such as healthcare, safety, military, and law enforcement, with a particular focus on medical and orthopedic soft goods. Its customers include U.S. brands and global manufacturers that require durable, mission-critical sewn and thermoformed products. The company emphasizes long-term partnerships and supply-chain reliability for clients in critical markets.

Rival differentiates itself through its U.S.-based headquarters, which provides real-time communication and fast decision-making, combined with global manufacturing reach. Its in-house design and development capabilities, on-site prototyping, strategic sourcing, and deep supplier relationships are intended to reduce risk, accelerate speed to market, and ensure quality outcomes. The company was built to move fast, think smart, and go global without losing sight of detail.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Cut & Sew", "Thermoforming", "Strap Fabrication", "Anti-Migration & Silicone Engineering", "Performance Materials Supply", "Engineering Phase-Gate Process", "Rapid Prototyping", "Strategic Sourcing", "Supplier Relationship Management", "End-to-End Project Service"], "industries": ["Medical & Orthopedic Soft Goods", "Healthcare", "Safety", "Military", "Law Enforcement"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "mid- to high-volume custom sewing", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["U.S. headquarters for real-time communication and fast decision-making", "Global facilities in the U.S., Vietnam, and China for scalable, cost-effective production", "In-house design and development with on-site prototyping to accelerate speed to market", "Engineering-led phase-gate process that rigorously manages product development", "Lean, capable team focused on responsiveness and supply-chain reliability"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Phoenix, Arizona -> db", "CEO Gerry Van Wagner -> /about", "Founded on 30+ years expertise in textile fabrication, sourcing, product design -> description (db)", "Services: Cut & Sew, Thermoforming, Strap Fabrication, Anti-Migration & Silicone, Performance Materials -> /services", "Global facilities in US, Vietnam, China -> /about and /", "Engineering Phase-Gate Process -> /about", "On-site Prototyping -> /about", "Strategic Sourcing -> /about", "Global Supplier Relationships -> /about", "Lean, capable tea