ndustries served: Orthopedic, Veterinary, Dental, Oncology, Sports medicine -> /, /about", "Quality system compliant with FDA Quality System Regulations and ISO 13485 -> /about", "New manufacturing facility in Costa Rica -> /", "Mission to rapidly innovate high-quality medical devices to improve patient outcomes -> /about", "Vertically integrated capabilities covering design, manufacturing, branding -> /capabilities", "Private labeling and packaging design services -> /about", "Family-owned ownership -> /about"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We Design, Develop, and Manufacture Implantable Textiles and Fibers", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='riverpoint-medical' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Riverside Sheet Metal & Contracting operates from Medford, Massachusetts, where it has been providing custom architectural metal fabrication for over three decades.

The shop fabricates a wide range of architectural metal products, including standing-seam metal roofing, copper and aluminum gutters and downspouts, chimney caps, cupolas, finials, flashing, and interior items such as copper, stainless steel, and zinc counter tops, backsplashes, and hood vents. In-house capabilities cover cutting, bending (with brakes and shears rated for 13-foot-2-inch lengths), forming, welding, soldering, plasma cutting, and panel curving. The company also fields installation crews that handle roofing, gutter, and accessory mounting on site.

Riverside serves the roofing and construction industries, supplying both contractors and homeowners. Its portfolio spans residential projects — custom gutters, chimney shrouds, and kitchen counter tops — as well as commercial work for restaurants and coffee shops that specify copper bar tops, zinc island tops, and outdoor counter tops. The firm also provides roofing supply and related sheet metal products to trade customers.

The company emphasizes that fabricating the products it installs allows it to control costs and quality, a point highlighted in its own messaging. Membership in the North East Roofing Contractors Association and the National Roofing Contractors Association, along with Massachusetts licensing (HIC #159489, CSL #CS40485), underscores its commitment to industry standards.', certifications=ARRAY['MA HIC REG. #159489','MA CSL #CS40485','North East Roofing Contractors Association member','National Roofing Contractors Association member']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom architectural sheet metal fabrication", "Chimney cap fabrication", "Copper gutter and downspout fabrication", "Copper pan fabrication", "Counter top fabrication (copper, stainless steel, zinc)", "Cupola fabrication", "Custom gutter fabrication", "Drip edge fabrication", "Edge metal fabrication", "Finial fabrication", "Flashing metal fabrication", "Gutter installation", "Hood vent fabrication", "Metal bending (up to 13'' 2\")", "Metal forming", "Metal roofing fabrication", "Metal roofing installation", "Metal panel curving", "Plasma cutting", "Roofing supply", "Shearing", "Sheet metal supply", "Skylight fabrication", "Soldering", "Welding"], "industries": ["Roofing industry", "Construction industry"], "materials": ["Copper", "Zinc", "Aluminum", "Steel", "Stainless steel"], "equipment": ["Brakes and shears (13'' 2\" capacity)"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["In-house fabrication and installation under one roof", "Brakes and shears with 13'' 2\" bending capacity", "Member of North East Roofing Contractors Association and National Roofing Contractors Association", "Fully licensed and insured in Massachusetts (HIC #159489, CSL #CS40485)"], "facts_used": ["Location: Medford, MA -> db", "Over three decades of experience -> /about", "Custom architectural sheet metal fabrication -> /", "Products: metal roofing, gutters, counter tops, chimney caps, cupolas, finials, flashi