UPDATE companies SET description='Rochford Supply operates from Brooklyn Park, Minnesota, where it has served manufacturers, fabricators, and commercial professionals for over 50 years. The company traces its roots to a focus on engineered specialty textiles for demanding environments, though the exact founding year and ownership structure are not publicly disclosed.

The company manufactures a range of branded product lines including eTek® Outdoor Textiles, Modality® Vinyls, ExtremeGrip® Adhesives, AquaTop® Marine fabrics, PowerSnap® Tools and Fasteners, CushionCraft® Foam & Upholstery, and Rochford® Essentials. These cover marine vinyl, outdoor performance fabrics, industrial adhesives, foam, webbing, hardware, thread, and zipper systems. Rochford emphasizes a design-to-delivery model, producing and stocking its own materials to enable same-day shipping on many items.

Rochford’s materials are used in marine, transportation, outdoor recreation, industrial, RV and automotive, motor sports, and commercial upholstery applications. Its customer base includes OEM manufacturers, custom fabricators, and commercial upholstery shops that require technical specification support and reliable inventory availability.

The company differentiates itself through manufacturer-backed brands, in-house technical experts who help customers select the right material, and a same-day shipping commitment for stocked products. Its “design to delivery” approach means it controls production and stands behind the performance of its textiles, adhesives, and hardware in real-world conditions.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Engineered specialty textile manufacturing", "Vinyl fabric manufacturing (including marine and contract vinyl)", "Adhesive formulation and manufacturing", "Foam fabrication (upholstery and marine)", "Fastener and hardware manufacturing (snaps, grommets, zippers)", "Webbing and binding production", "Thread and bobbin manufacturing", "Custom fabrication services", "Same-day shipping for stocked inventory", "Technical material specification support"], "industries": ["Marine", "Transportation", "Outdoor recreation", "Industrial", "Upholstery", "Commercial fabrication", "RV and automotive", "Motor sports"], "materials": ["Polyester (including PVC-backed)", "Vinyl (marine, contract, motor sports)", "Nylon", "Foam (upholstery, marine, antimicrobial)", "Adhesives (vinyl cement, foam & fabric adhesive)", "Thread (indoor, outdoor, extreme)", "Webbing", "Hardware (snaps, grommets, zippers, fasteners)"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Same-day shipping for stocked items", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Manufacturer-backed brands with proven performance", "Technical experts assist with material specification", "Same-day shipping on stocked items", "Over 50 years of engineering expertise", "Design-to-delivery manufacturing control"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Brooklyn Park, Minnesota -> db", "Over 50 years in business -> /", "Manufactures branded product lines (eTek, Modality, ExtremeGrip, AquaTop, PowerSnap, CushionCraft, Rochford Essentials) -> /", "Design-to-delivery model with same-day shipping for stocked items -> /", "Industries served: 