UPDATE companies SET description='Rubicon Automotive Group is based in Grants Pass, Oregon. The company was founded by George Roeske and became a reality in the summer of 2018, after the concept originated as a college business plan in 2004. Roeske brought twenty-eight years of experience in the auto recycling industry to the venture, leaving employment to establish his own business.

