UPDATE companies SET description='SCSP Solar operates from Charleston, South Carolina, as a family-owned and operated solar installation company. The firm leverages more than 30 years of combined expertise in clean energy, though a specific founding year is not disclosed. The team includes personnel such as Jon Mason, Nick, and Tayler, who appear in customer reviews as points of contact for design and project management.

