UPDATE companies SET description='SENTIENT Furniture & Design Gallery was founded in 2012 by Nersi Nasseri and Ali Yavari in the Greenpoint neighborhood of Brooklyn, New York. The studio occupies a 25,000-square-foot workshop that has housed craft and creative work for over three decades. Nasseri serves as president and creative director, while Yavari is CEO.

The company designs and fabricates custom furniture for residential, hospitality, and commercial projects. All processes—design, woodworking, metal fabrication, finishing, and upholstery—are performed in-house by a team of 25–30 craftspeople. The workshop can produce a single bespoke piece or a full furniture program for a 200-room hotel.

